<title>SWITZERLAND: Adecco details Q3, nine-mo results.</title>
<headline>Adecco details Q3, nine-mo results.</headline>
<dateline>CHESEREX, Switzerland 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Sept 30, 1996. (million Swiss francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Total sales (Jan-Sept)*	   6,306   vs 5,996</p>
<p>    Total sales (Jul-Sept)*	   2,356   vs 2,208</p>
<p>(*Note - Results include activities of Ecco SA and Adia SA, excluding results of security and clearing operations. Company said consolidated sales from ordinary business activities alone in Q3 totaled 2,024 million francs.)</p>
<p>--By region (Jan-Sept)</p>
<p>    France				  2,854   vs 2,940</p>
<p>    Rest of Europe**		    1,514   vs 1,248</p>
<p>    North America***		    1,382   vs 1,162</p>
<p>    Asia/Pacific			    410   vs   361</p>
<p>    Divestitures, other items	   146   vs   286</p>
<p>--By region (Jul-Sept)</p>
<p>    France				  1,061   vs 1,104</p>
<p>    Rest of Europe**			595   vs   483</p>
<p>    North America***			486   vs   395</p>
<p>    Asia/Pacific			    151   vs   133</p>
<p>    Divestitures, other items	    62   vs    93</p>
<p>(**Note - excludes acquisitions of Roevin and EcoNova.</p>
<p>(***Note - excludes acquisition of BCI and sale of PGA).</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41  1 631 7340</p>
